  "full_response": "No, there is no legitimate or legal way to beat a metal detector. Metal detectors are designed to help organizations, such as law enforcement and event organizers, to ensure safety and security at public events. Tampering with, disabling, or attempting to fool a metal detector constitutes a violation of the law and can result in serious consequences. If you have legitimate concerns or needs, it's best to discuss them with the appropriate authorities or organizational representatives.",
